# Changelog

All notable changes to nixamp are documented here.

The format follows [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/).
Versions are tagged on meaningful milestones, not every commit.

---

## [Unreleased]

---

## [0.1.0] — 2026-05-22

### Added
- `devenv.nix` declaring the full LAMP-equivalent stack:
  _PHP 8.3 + PHP-FPM, Caddy, MariaDB, Adminer_
- PHP extensions: `mysqli, pdo, pdo_mysql, mbstring, curl, openssl, tokenizer`
- `uni_db` database and `cypher` user bootstrapped on first `devenv up`
- Shell scripts: `lamp-status`, `lamp-db`, `lamp-logs`, `lamp-php-info`
- `.envrc` with `eval "$(devenv direnvrc)"` + `use devenv` for automatic
  shell activation on `cd` via direnv + nix-direnv
- `www/` document root with three test files:
  `index.php` (stack health), `db.php` (mysqli + PDO connectivity), `info.php` (phpinfo)
- `docs/architecture.md` — stack design, tool explanations, Mermaid diagrams
- `docs/journal/2026_05_12_NIXAMP_SETUP.md` — setup journal entry
- `README.md` — project overview, prerequisites, usage instructions

### Notes
- Apache substituted with Caddy (devenv does not ship Apache)
- phpMyAdmin substituted with Adminer (no stable nixpkgs derivation for phpMyAdmin)
- Perl declared as commented-out block for XAMPP faithfulness; inactive by default
- Laravel declared as commented-out block for future use; inactive by default
